{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31146","headline":"送崔学士赴东川 · 薛能","name":"送崔学士赴东川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽人仙籍冠浮丘，欲作酇侯且蜀侯。\n导骑已多行劒阁，亲军全到近绵州。\n文翁劝学人应恋，魏绦和戎戍自休。\n唯有夜罇懽莫厌，庙堂他日少闲游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}